Commands for the ai.nested extension namespace.

Usage
  azd ai nested [command]

Available Commands
  example : Nested test extension.

Global Flags
      --docs : Opens the documentation for azd ai nested in your web browser.
  -h, --help : Gets help for nested.

Examples
  Explore commands in this namespace
    azd ai nested --help

Use azd ai nested [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
